#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: archive: add reviewed Klipper axis twist compensation"
msgctxt "[\"Klipper\",\"axis_twist_compensation_sv.po\",\"\",\"51\",\"05af6955f144f98cc3d904d6\"]"
msgid "**Warning**: This module is not compatible with dockable probes yet and will try to probe the bed without attaching the probe if you use it."
msgstr "**Varning:** Modulen är ännu inte kompatibel med dockningsbara sonder och försöker sonda bädden utan att fästa sonden om den används."

# Review: 062314036e8f96473df751a1
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/f0d9967b8be25767825c75fed0f03522196a748e/Klipper/canbus_sv.po
# Evidence-SHA256: 86a1a2e1b7edaefc689844169bec07e0dc748d5808d37939e80dc8e8ba2c1666
