# Review: 0b39c41b7884028b612b8f48
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/79dfc5f3d32ccdfa5522bf896017cf20ec763674/Klipper/canbus_protocol_sv.po
# Evidence-SHA256: 1e0860e3ef445e2fef95384e8723eec92d4541187e392c430ba88cfa45f55590
# Source-evidence: {}
