msgid "Use a slicer to generate g-code for the large hollow square found in [docs/prints/square_tower.stl](prints/square_tower.stl). Use a high speed (eg, 100mm/s), zero infill, and a coarse layer height (the layer height should be around 75% of the nozzle diameter). Make sure any \"dynamic acceleration control\" and \"scarf joint\" seams are disabled in the slicer."
