msgctxt "[\"Klipper\",\"multi_mcu_homing_sv.po\",\"\",\"60\",\"c21a59489d8b450393c0e552\"]"
msgid "So, for example, if homing at 10mm/s then it is possible for an overshoot of up to 0.250mm (10mm/s * .025s == 0.250mm). Care should be taken when configuring multi-mcu homing to account for this type of overshoot. Using slower homing or probing speeds can reduce the overshoot."
