msgid "Printing temperature and extrusion rates can impact pressure advance. Be sure to tune the [extruder rotation_distance](Rotation_Distance.md#calibrating-rotation_distance-on-extruders) and [nozzle temperature](http://reprap.org/wiki/Triffid_Hunter%27s_Calibration_Guide#Nozzle_Temperature) prior to tuning pressure advance."
